flowchart TD
    A[Create session] --> B[Load role, JD, resume facts, rubric]
    B --> C[Select next question]
    C --> D[Present question]
    D --> E[Candidate submits text or voice answer]
    E --> F{Voice mode?}
    F -- Yes --> G[ASR transcript + timing features]
    F -- No --> H[Normalize text + timing]
    G --> I[Safety and PII checks]
    H --> I
    I --> J{Blocked or unsafe?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Safe re-prompt / human-review flag]
    J -- No --> L[Extract NLP features]
    L --> M[Similarity indicator]
    M --> N[ML prediction]
    N --> O[NVIDIA LLM rubric explanation]
    O --> P[Application validates schema and calculates score]
    P --> Q{Session budget remaining?}
    Q -- No --> R[Generate final report]
    Q -- Yes --> S{Answer incomplete or weak?}
    S -- Yes --> T[Generate targeted follow-up]
    S -- No --> U[Select next competency question]
    T --> D
    U --> D
    K --> D
    R --> V[Dashboard trends and recommendations]
    style A fill:#0f172a,color:#fff
    style E fill:#2563eb,color:#fff
    style P fill:#7c3aed,color:#fff
    style R fill:#059669,color:#fff